world  catapult into a bucket

floor
  size      8 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

catapult
  is a          catapult
  pivot height  50 cm
  arm length    60 cm
  arm mass      500 g
  swings        from 0° to 45°
  spring        2.98 N·m/rad toward 180°
  damping       0 N·m·s/rad
  armature      0.01 kg·m²
  colour        wood
  stands        on floor

ball
  is a      sphere 4 cm radius, 100 g
  rolls
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  colour    orange
  moves     freely
  rests     on catapult.scoop base, at catapult.scoop base's near end

bucket
  is an     open box
  length    80 cm
  width     80 cm
  walls     25 cm
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.9, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.01
  colour    grey
  stands    on floor, its base 3 m beyond ball

expect
  ball comes to rest in bucket
